      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B001",
      "text": "freeze_time accepts date/time text as a context manager or decorator, makes datetime.now() report the requested time, and restores the real clock after the scope exits."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B002",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B002",
      "text": "The factory returned by an active freeze exposes tick(delta=...) and move_to(target_datetime); these operations advance or replace the time subsequently observed through datetime.now()."
    },
    {
      "behavior_id": "B003",
      "clause_kind": "included_behavior",
      "spec_anchor": "metadata.json#/public_spec/behaviors/B003",
      "text": "The package exposes freeze_time and the three factory classes, including each factory's tick and move_to methods, with the kinds listed in this contract."
    },
